                        "Details": "You look toward Bagele, then back to the screen.\r\n\r\n \"Fine. Three million. Transfer ALL of the Hatchetman.\"\r\n\r\n The pirate immediately claps his hands together. \"Thank you, Commander, today you demonstrate remarkable intelligence and impeccable taste.\"\r\n\r\n \"Don't make me regret it.\" you glower at the pirate\r\n\r\n \"Too late. I want this Battlemech out of my sight immediately.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele doesn't seem to hear the rest of the conversation, staring at the image of his BattleMech with a grin stretching from ear to ear.\r\n\r\n \"I'll arrange delivery of as much as we can find of it by the end of the day.\" the pirate says. \"Pleasure doing business with you once again.\"\r\n\r\nThe transmission ends with Bagele still staring at the now-blank screen.",
